red"],"surfaces":["安"],"status":"contextual_provisional","confidence_level":"high","evidence":[{"work_id":"w-jinshu","book_id":"b-jinshu-073","source_id":"s-jinshu-073-yu-lunzan-ws2296501-rendered","chapter_id":"c-jinshu-073-yu-lunzan-rendered","paragraph_id":"c-jinshu-073-yu-lunzan-rendered:p001","mention_id":"c-jinshu-073-yu-lunzan-rendered:p001:m0254","quote":"史臣曰：外戚之家，連輝椒掖，舅氏之族，同氣蘭閨，靡不憑藉寵私，階緣險謁。門藏金穴，地使其驕；馬控龍媒，勢成其逼。古者右賢左戚，用杜溺私之路，愛而知惡，深慎滿覆之災，是以厚贈瓊瑰，罕升津要。塗山在夏，靡與禼稷同驅；姒氏居周，不預燕齊等列。聖人慮遠，殊有旨哉！搢昵元規，參聞顧命。然其筆敷華藻，吻縱濤波，方駕搢紳，足為翹楚。而智小謀大，昧經邦之遠圖；才高識寡，闕安國之長算。璿萼見誅，物議稱其拔本；牙尺垂訓，帝念深於負芒。是使蘇祖尋戈，宗祧殆覆。已而猜嫌上宰，謀黜負圖。向使郗鑒協從，必且戎車犯順，則與夫台、產、安、桀，亦何以異哉！幸漏吞舟，免淪昭憲，是庾宗之大福，非晉政之不綱明矣。懌恣凶懷，鴆加連率，再世之後，三陽存僅，餘殃所及，蓋其宜也。"}],"rationale":"漢書007明皇后父上官安、桀子安及謀反伏誅；新實讀漢書068L8明桀子安/安女皇后、L9/L12並列桀安通謀/受誅，閉合外戚論安桀兩名。007四庫見證只作已存參校，不借其當本次晉書底本；068未知印本普通數位文字。","literal_source_name_alias":true,"human_reviewed":false,"reviewer":"Codex（AI代理）","source_reading_keys":["corpus/hanshu/007.json:empress-father:p001","corpus/hanshu/007.json:conspiracy:p001","hanshu068-and-jin066-primary-tool-observation.txt:L8-L12"],"reference_readings_path":"source-evidence/jin073-yu-lunzan-rendered/parallel-primary-readings.json"}],"equivalence_decisions":[],"passages":[{"id":"c-hanshu-007-zhaodi:conspiracy:p001","text":"九月鄂邑長公主燕王旦與左將軍上官桀桀子票騎將軍安御史大夫桑𢎞羊皆謀反伏誅","text_layer":"received_chapter","annotation_status":"in_progress","mentions":[{"id":"c-hanshu-007-zhaodi:conspiracy:p001:m0002","start":2,"end":7,"surface":"鄂邑長公主","kind":"person","person_id":"6it_qfa_gdg","status":"contextual_provisional"},{"id":"c-hanshu-007-zhaodi:conspiracy:p001:m0007","start":7,"end":10,"surface":"燕王旦","kind":"person","person_id":"yqp_nlb_p1p_ACAAB","status":"contextual_provisional"},{"id":"c-hanshu-007-zhaodi:conspiracy:p001:m0014","start":14,"end":17,"surface":"上官桀","kind":"person","person_id":"1kj_vhc_cx9","status":"contextual_provisional"},{"id":"c-hanshu-007-zhaodi:conspiracy:p001:m0017","start":17,"end":18,"surface":"桀","kind":"person","person_id":"1kj_vhc_cx9","status"